inues to blur.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qWFQ96WqwyOxvJYCoKAMQfoBllM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-01-11\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Jimmy and Toh cross the last line, and Toh falls deeply in love with Jimmy. But on the other side, Jimmy uses this relationship to threaten Teh into staying away from Plaifah. Is this a battle of true love or just another dangerous game of romance?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6egHFuOclikeH4zNYQEGoAPfoYx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-01-18\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Jimmy uses Toh as a bargaining chip, but as he shares intimate moments with him, he finds himself unknowingly drawn to Toh’s innocence. Meanwhile, Teh and Plaifah quietly begin a secret underground romance…\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pxSEqlyP14AUtg6eqnP5nrw5d5K.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-01-25\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Toh fights to save the relationship as Jimmy’s mixed signals and his ex’s return push them to the brink.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y4Zxsi6GnGwvorLTKZf55eBXfhV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-01\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Newly single Toh meets kindhearted Freeze, while Jimmy realizes too late that he still loves him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sZGilM7BC3FUfrfMh3QQyOkbPDo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-08\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lIrCfy79efsak63c7KBmchNV62h.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-15\",\"runtime\":55},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lhrb27AkohNm52NZJqzwqhFeA5s.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteC